1
00:00:00,769 --> 00:00:03,229
[LAUGH ING]

2
00:00:06,233 --> 00:00:10,233
(Raj:)I am Shiva, the destroyer.
I will have the woman.

3
00:00:11,113 --> 00:00:15,073
(Howard:)I'm warning you.
I was judo champion at math camp.

4
00:00:15,450 --> 00:00:17,490
All right.
That's enough juvenile squabbling.

5
00:00:17,661 --> 00:00:19,741
You stop it. You stop it, I say.

6
00:00:21,039 --> 00:00:23,129
I'm gonna settle this right now.

7
00:00:23,291 --> 00:00:25,751
(Sheldon:)Neither of you are good enough
for my sister.

8
00:00:25,919 --> 00:00:27,499
(Howard:)Who are you to decide that?

9
00:00:27,671 --> 00:00:30,381
(Leonard:)He's the man of his family.
You have to respect his wishes.

10
00:00:30,549 --> 00:00:33,139
- You're out too, by the way.
- Say what?

11
00:00:33,301 --> 00:00:35,641
(Sheldon:)Nothing personal.
I'd prefer my niece or nephew...

12
00:00:35,804 --> 00:00:39,434
(Sheldon:)...didn't become flatulent
every time they ate an Eskimo Pie.

13
00:00:45,731 --> 00:00:48,571
- What are you so happy about?
- I'm not happy.

14
00:00:48,734 --> 00:00:58,024
(Raj:)It's the medication. I can't stop smiling.

